        "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A wealthy aristocrat has passed into the afterlife and become a ghost. Now he must be settled into this new existence with the same level of comfort he was accustomed to. This won’t be easy-especially considering his high standards...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This game is a bit more challenging than others in the series-it includes:<br>100 challenging Match-3 levels (if you get stuck, use the Hint button!),<br>15 skippable Mahjong puzzles (also not the easiest, but all solvable!),<br>15 skippable Blocks games,<br>8 skippable Spot-the-Difference scenes,<br>and a city to build that will satisfy even the most demanding aristocrat.</p>",
